  "question": "For $$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\quad B=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix},$$ verify that $3(A+B)=3A+3B$.",
